  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Reality vs. Simulation**\n\nI think I\'m starting to understand this now. We really need to distinguish between what\'s real and what\'s simulated. It feels like the key is separating the authentic elements from the generated or artificial ones. I\'m focusing on defining the boundaries.\n\n\n**Clarifying Core Structures**\n\nI\'m now separating the real from the simulated, pinpointing three key spheres. There\'s the central HQ for overall management, the operational system for each registered business, and the public-facing pages for the end consumer. It\'s becoming clearer how the SaaS owner\'s control differs from the individual business operations. I\'m focusing on their interrelationship and how each element serves its own function.\n\n\n"
